        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Joe Cornish, Steven Moffat, Edgar Wright, Adam McKay, Paul Rudd, John Boyega, Nick Frost, Jodie Whittaker, Luke Treadaway\n- Works: Attack the Block, The Kid Who Would Be King, Ant-Man, Tintin\n- Topics: film writing, film directing, acting\n\nFacts:\n- Joe Cornish co-wrote \"Tintin\" with Steven Moffat and Edgar Wright.\n- Joe Cornish co-wrote \"Ant-Man\" with Edgar Wright, Adam McKay, and Paul Rudd.\n- \"Attack the Block\" is a 2011 British science fiction horror comedy film written and directed by Joe Cornish.\n- \"Attack the Block\" stars John Boyega, Nick Frost, Jodie Whittaker, and Luke Treadaway.\n- \"The Kid Who Would Be King\" is an upcoming British-American adventure drama film written and directed by Joe Cornish.",
